{
  "info": {
    "name": "Entrega 1 - Microservicio Lista Negra Global",
    "description": "Escenarios de prueba del microservicio de lista negra global de emails.\n\n**Autorizacion:** todos los endpoints de negocio exigen el encabezado `Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_token}}`. El health check (`GET /`) es publico porque lo consume el balanceador de AWS Elastic Beanstalk.\n\n**Variables:** configure el environment `blacklist-microservice` con `base_url` (la URL del entorno de Beanstalk) y `bearer_token` (el valor de `STATIC_BEARER_TOKEN`).\n\nLa coleccion completa puede ejecutarse con el Collection Runner: cada solicitud incluye aserciones automaticas.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "nuevo_email",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Email aleatorio generado en tiempo de ejecucion para el escenario de alta exitosa."
    },
    {
      "key": "email_sin_motivo",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Email aleatorio usado por el escenario sin blocked_reason."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Health check (GET /)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "pm.test('El estado es ok', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok'); });",
              "pm.test('No requiere token', function () { pm.expect(pm.request.headers.has('Authorization')).to.be.false; });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            ""
          ]
        },
        "description": "Verificacion de vida usada por el health check de Elastic Beanstalk. No consulta la base de datos y no requiere token."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "200 OK",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/"
            }
          },
          "status": "OK",
          "code": 200,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [
            {
              "key": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ],
          "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"service\": \"blacklist-microservice\",\n  \"time\": \"2026-10-17T15:21:22.354718+00:00\"\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 - POST /blacklists - alta exitosa (201)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "// Email unico por ejecucion, para que el escenario sea repetible.",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('nuevo_email', 'cliente-' + Date.now() + '@example.com');"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Responde 201', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('created es true', function () { pm.expect(body.created).to.be.true; });",
              "pm.test('Devuelve el email normalizado', function () { pm.expect(body.data.email).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('nuevo_email').toLowerCase()); });",
              "pm.test('El servidor registro la IP de la solicitud', function () { pm.expect(body.data.request_ip).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; });",
              "pm.test('El servidor registro la fecha/hora', function () { pm.expect(body.data.created_at).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Bearer {{bearer_token}}"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{nuevo_email}}\",\n  \"app_uuid\": \"3f0c1b9a-6d2e-4a1b-9c8d-5e7f2a1b3c4d\",\n  \"blocked_reason\": \"Reportado por abuso por el area legal\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/blacklists",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "blacklists"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Agrega un email a la lista negra global.\n\n**Parametros del cuerpo**\n\n| Campo | Tipo | Obligatorio | Reglas |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `email` | String | Si | Formato de email valido, maximo 254 caracteres |\n| `app_uuid` | String | Si | UUID valido de la app cliente |\n| `blocked_reason` | String | No | Maximo 255 caracteres |\n\nLa direccion IP del solicitante y la fecha/hora se registran internamente por el microservicio; no se aceptan como parametros de entrada."
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "name": "201 Created",
          "originalRequest": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <token>"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"spam@example.com\",\n  \"app_uuid\": \"3f0c1b9a-6d2e-4a1b-9c8d-5e7f2a1b3c4d\",\n  \"blocked_reason\": \"Reportado por abuso\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/blacklists"
            }
          },
          "status": "Created",
          "code": 201,
          "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
          "header": [
            {
              "key": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ],
          "body": "{\n  \"created\": true,\n  \"message\": \"El email fue agregado a la lista negra global.\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": 1,\n    \"email\": \"spam@example.com\",\n    \"app_uuid\": \"3f0c1b9a-6d2e-4a1b-9c8d-5e7f2a1b3c4d\",\n    \"blocked_reason\": \"Reportado por abuso\",\n    \"request_ip\": \"186.28.14.77\",\n    \"created_at\": \"2026-10-17T15:21:22.759276\"\n  }\n}"
        }
      ]
    },
